# PrivacySentry AI

PrivacySentry AI is an intelligent personal privacy protection system that scans text for common privacy-sensitive information.

## Features

- Detects privacy-sensitive information in text
- Simple Streamlit web interface
- Privacy and security focused
- Runs locally

## Technology

- Python 3.12
- Streamlit 1.40.1
- python-dotenv 1.0.1
- requests 2.32.3
- pandas 2.2.3
- numpy 1.26.4
- scikit-learn 1.5.2
- pydantic 2.10.3

## How to Run

1. Open the project in VS Code.
2. Activate the virtual environment.
3. Open the VS Code terminal.
4. Run:

```bash
streamlit run app.py